			<div class="content" id="post-content-1696161">
									

<p>Actually&#8230; not really.</p>
<p>It's more that the Foundation's reaction to the evidence shown is deeply stupid. The Foundation is <em>not</em> stupider than your average reader. They <em>would</em> devote surveillance to it, even if it showed no results. And they would do something about Dr. R███. And do what they could to <em>contain</em> their employees who apparently might not be in control of themselves.</p>
<p>On further thought, they'd do this regardless of &quot;nice try&quot;. In other words, this a pointless way for an otherwise excellent article to shoot itself in the foot.</p>
<p>I dunno. I want to make it work in my head. I guess if the Level 4 stuff is a cover? Maybe because some of the Level 4s reading that info are in fact affected by the bus? And containment of them is a work in progress? Hm.</p>

							</div>

								
